{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Similariddle Demo</i> is a challenging word-guess game.\u00a0After guessing a word, the system will provide the &quot;Similarity&quot; in spelling between it and a randomly pre-generated word, and you need to find the correct word through guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 4000 possible words to guess</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of different guessing sound effects, feel the current progress from the sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mute button, if you want to think quietly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to be an expert:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different commonly used affixes (such as -al -tion con- re-, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attempt to combine the letters shared by the words with the highest current similarity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you get stuck, you can change your direction and try some letters that have not appeared much yet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorize  more words</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3426620?t=1761211614","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3426620?t=1761211614","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426620/b4198f80eccd3d54cfbac99a7c6de62f407e183e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761211614","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426620/b4198f80eccd3d54cfbac99a7c6de62f407e183e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761211614","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Similariddle Demo</i> is a challenging word-guess game.\u00a0Aft